implementationPlan.description:
STEP 4 — THE DISPATCHER. Edit `apps/control-room/src/v2/goals/live-goal-create.ts` (148 lines; keep under 250). `createGoalDispatcher` is at :111.

Branch on whether a PRD is present: PRESENT -> `buildGoalWithSourceCommand` with the text step 2 made reachable; ABSENT -> the existing `goal.create` path, UNCHANGED and byte-identical to today.

PRESERVE dc934111's DELIVERED BEHAVIOUR EXACTLY (task rail 3, DoD-4) — this row consumes it, it does not revise it:
- `GoalCreateResult` reused UNCHANGED;
- a refusal from EITHER kind keeps the form and draft visible and renders `CODE @ LAYER`;
- success closes the form ONCE, and the goal appears ONLY when the durable catalog frame carries its id. NO locally formatted id is ever rendered as though durable — that is the clause a well-meaning optimistic update breaks, and it is the difference between showing the operator a fact and showing them a guess;
- `briefOfDraft`'s `PRD:` line (live-goal-create.ts:36) stays the LOCAL DIGEST. This row does not change what the brief says, and an arm asserts the brief is unchanged so a reader cannot mistake the source-carrying payload for a brief change.

THE PRD REACHES THE DAEMON ONLY INSIDE THE COMMAND (task rail 1, and the human's 2026-08-27 atomic-source-leg decision): no `/documents/ingest` from this form on any path, no second write, no compensating delete. If the bytes cannot travel inside the command for a measured reason, STOP and report — do not add a second write to make it work.

EXPECTED PAYLOADS ARE COMPUTED THROUGH THE PRODUCTION HELPERS, never hand-built (task rail 4). A hand-built expectation is a fixed point no mutation can red.

Re-run the control-room suite: the with-source arm, the no-PRD regression arm, the unchanged-brief arm and the zero-ingest arm all green. Quote the count line.
